Template: ultimate/title
Type: title
Description: Ultimate Installer: branch, init, kernel and desktop
Description-es.UTF-8: Ultimate Installer: rama, init, núcleo y escritorio

Template: ultimate/branch
Type: select
Choices-C: stable, testing
Choices: stable, testing (Debian testing)
Choices-es.UTF-8: stable, testing (Debian testing)
Default: stable
Description: Branch:
 stable installs Genuen, Devuan or Debian, depending on the init and
 kernel chosen next.
 .
 testing installs Debian testing; it uses systemd and needs an Internet
 connection.
Description-es.UTF-8: Rama:
 stable: Genuen, Devuan o Debian, según el init y el núcleo.
 .
 testing: Debian testing. Usa systemd y necesita Internet.

Template: ultimate/init
Type: select
Choices-C: sysvinit, openrc, systemd, runit, s6
Choices: SysV, OpenRC, systemd, runit, s6 (linux-libre only)
Choices-es.UTF-8: SysV, OpenRC, systemd, runit, s6 (solo linux-libre)
Default: sysvinit
Description: Init system:
 SysV, OpenRC and runit install Devuan from this disc; with linux-libre,
 OpenRC installs Genuen, and SysV and runit get linux-libre from the
 Internet.
 .
 s6 comes from Genuen, so it needs linux-libre and an Internet connection.
 systemd installs Debian stable and needs an Internet connection.
Description-es.UTF-8: Sistema de inicio (init):
 SysV, OpenRC y runit: Devuan, desde este disco. Con linux-libre, OpenRC
 instala Genuen, y SysV y runit descargan linux-libre de Internet.
 .
 s6: Genuen, solo con linux-libre (necesita Internet).
 systemd: Debian stable (necesita Internet).

Template: ultimate/kernel
Type: select
Choices-C: ${KERNELS_C}
Choices: ${KERNELS}
Choices-es.UTF-8: ${KERNELS}
Default: linux-libre
Description: Kernel:
 ${HWNOTE}
Description-es.UTF-8: Núcleo:
 ${HWNOTE}

Template: ultimate/components
Type: multiselect
Choices-C: ${COMPS_C}
Choices: ${COMPS}
Choices-es.UTF-8: ${COMPS}
Description: Repositories:
 ${MAINNOTE}
 .
 Extra repositories to enable:
Description-es.UTF-8: Repositorios:
 ${MAINNOTE} Repositorios adicionales:

Template: ultimate/desktop
Type: select
Choices-C: ${DESKTOPS_C}
Choices: ${DESKTOPS}
Choices-es.UTF-8: ${DESKTOPS}
Default: mate
Description: Desktop:
 ${DESKNOTE}
Description-es.UTF-8: Escritorio:
 ${DESKNOTE}

Template: ultimate/graphics
Type: select
Choices-C: x11, xlibre
Choices: X11 (Xorg), XLibre
Default: x11
Description: X server:
 X11 is the classic X server (Xorg), from the distro. XLibre is a fork of
 Xorg that is still developed, from its own repository (xlibre-debian).
Description-es.UTF-8: Servidor X:
 X11: el servidor X de siempre (Xorg), de la distro. XLibre: fork de Xorg
 que sigue en desarrollo, desde su repositorio (xlibre-debian).

